# Charged ollie, 360 Inward Heelflip (J + up right, then J again: the remake's double tap on that slot, added
# 2026-11-16) right after the pop: the flip finishes and the combo lands (./skate strip --sheet scenarios/flips.strips).
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap flip+up+right 96
tap flip 99
run 300
expect event trickStart{trick=360 Inward Heelflip} within 100..100
expect event trickEnd{trick=360 Inward Heelflip} within 120..180
expect event comboLanded{name=360 Inward Heelflip,points=650} within 160..240
expect no event bail
